@startuml UC-13-Moderasi-Konten
title Sequence Diagram: Moderasi Materi dan Kuis (Admin)

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Dashboard Admin\nHalaman Moderasi\n(React)" as UI
participant "GET /api/admin/content\nPUT /api/admin/content/:id/moderate\nDELETE /api/admin/content/:id" as API
participant "ModerationController" as Controller
participant "ModerationService\nNotificationService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Materi, Kuis,\nModerationLog,\nPengguna)" as DB
participant "AWS S3" as S3

Admin -> UI: Mengakses menu\n"Kelola Materi / Kuis"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/admin/content
activate API
API -> Controller: getAllContent()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getContentList()
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Materi\nUNION\nSELECT * FROM Kuis\nORDER BY tanggalUnggah DESC
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return array semua konten\n(materi + kuis) dengan info:\njudul, creator, tanggal,\nstatus, view/pengerjaan
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: [...] }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data konten
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Menampilkan daftar konten\ndengan kolom lengkap
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan filter (status,\ncreator, tanggal) dan pencarian
Admin -> UI: Mencari dan memilih konten\nyang perlu dimoderasi
UI -> API: GET /api/admin/content/:id
activate API
API -> Controller: getContentDetail(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getDetailWithCreator(id)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT konten dengan JOIN\nke Pengguna untuk info creator
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return konten lengkap\ndengan detail creator
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: {...} }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Detail konten
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Menampilkan preview konten\ndan detail creator
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan menu aksi:\nSembunyikan, Hapus Permanen,\nApprove/Pulihkan

== Flow Normal - Sembunyikan Konten ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih aksi "Sembunyikan"
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan dialog dengan\nfield "Alasan Moderasi"
Admin -> UI: Isi alasan moderasi\n(misal: "Konten spam")
Admin -> UI: Klik "Ya, Sembunyikan"
UI -> API: PUT /api/admin/content/:id/moderate\n{ action: 'hide', reason: '...' }
activate API
API -> Controller: moderateContent(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: hideContent(id, reason, adminId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Service -> DB: UPDATE Materi/Kuis SET\nstatus_publik = false,\nalasan_moderate = '[reason]',\nmoderated_by = '[adminId]',\nmoderated_at = NOW()\nWHERE id = '[id]'
DB --> Service: UPDATE success
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO ModerationLog\n(admin_id, content_id, content_type,\naction, reason, timestamp)\nVALUES ('[adminId]', '[contentId]',\n'materi', 'hide', '[reason]', NOW())
DB --> Service: Log saved
Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> Service: Transaction committed
deactivate DB
Service ->> NotificationService: notifyCreator(creatorId,\n'content_hidden', reason)
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Konten berhasil disembunyikan"
UI -> UI: Update status konten\ndi daftar
deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow A - Hapus Permanen ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih aksi "Hapus Paksa"
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan peringatan\n"PERHATIAN: Hapus permanen.\nSemua data (riwayat belajar,\nkomentar, rating) terhapus"
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan field alasan\ndan konfirmasi (ketik "HAPUS")
Admin -> UI: Isi alasan dan ketik "HAPUS"
Admin -> UI: Klik "Ya, Hapus Permanen"
UI -> API: DELETE /api/admin/content/:id\n{ reason: '...' }
activate API
API -> Controller: deleteContent(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: permanentDeleteContent(id, reason, adminId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Service -> DB: SELECT fileUrls, idPenulis\nFROM Materi/Kuis\nWHERE id = '[id]'
DB --> Service: Return file URLs dan creator ID
Service -> DB: DELETE FROM Materi/Kuis\nWHERE id = '[id]'\n(cascade delete ke RiwayatBelajar,\nKomentar, Rating, Soal)
DB --> Service: CASCADE DELETE success
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO ModerationLog\n(admin_id, content_id, action,\nreason)\nVALUES ('[adminId]', '[contentId]',\n'delete', '[reason]')
DB --> Service: Log saved
Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> Service: Transaction committed
deactivate DB
Service ->> S3: Delete semua file aset\ndari S3 bucket
Service ->> NotificationService: Notifikasi ke creator
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Konten berhasil dihapus"
UI -> UI: Hapus entry dari daftar
deactivate UI

== Alternate Flow B - Approve/Pulihkan ==

Admin -> UI: Pilih konten tersembunyi,\nklik "Pulihkan / Approve"
activate UI
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan konfirmasi\n"Pulihkan konten dan buat\npublik kembali?"
Admin -> UI: Klik "Ya, Pulihkan"
UI -> API: PUT /api/admin/content/:id/approve
activate API
API -> Controller: approveContent(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: approveContent(id, adminId)
activate Service
Service -> DB: UPDATE Materi/Kuis SET\nstatus_publik = true,\nalasan_moderate = NULL,\nmoderated_by = '[adminId]'\nWHERE id = '[id]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: UPDATE success
deactivate DB
Service -> DB: INSERT INTO ModerationLog\n(admin_id, content_id, action)\nVALUES ('[adminId]', '[contentId]',\n'approve')
activate DB
DB --> Service: Log saved
deactivate DB
Service ->> NotificationService: Notifikasi "Konten disetujui"
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Response sukses
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Tampilkan notifikasi\n"Konten berhasil dipulihkan"
UI -> UI: Update status konten
deactivate UI

== Alternate: Melihat History Moderasi ==

Admin -> UI: Klik "Lihat History"
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/admin/content/:id/history
activate API
API -> Controller: getModerationHistory(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getHistory(id)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM ModerationLog\nWHERE content_id = '[id]'\nORDER BY timestamp DESC
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return history\n(siapa moderate, kapan, alasan)
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: Return history data
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data history
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> Admin: Menampilkan timeline\nhistory moderasi
deactivate UI

== Exception: Konten Sedang Digunakan ==

note over Service, DB
  Jika ada pengguna sedang
  mengerjakan kuis saat dihapus:
  - Tampilkan warning
  - Handle gracefully jika lanjut
    (simpan progress, notif ke user)
end note

@enduml
